## 2. Freshness windows — runtime validation

### 2.1 `v2_native_ingestors` (FRESH)

- `generated_at=2026-05-31T06:59:10Z`, `freshness_seconds=0`, `process_running=true` (descriptor mtime epoch `1780210875` — re-stamped after anchor capture, evidence of ongoing 60 s loop).
